{"id":"bf5ab72b4278710c","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-nfuniq.md","title":"Normal-form representations are not unique","display":"thm-nfuniq — Normal-form representations are not unique","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-nfuniq","aliases":["27-thm-nfuniq"],"display":"thm-nfuniq — Normal-form representations are not unique","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-cnf]]"],"local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-nfuniq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-nfuniq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nfuniq — Normal-form representations are not unique"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq2\">\\(n\\geq2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_1,D_2,C_1,C_2\">\\(D_1,D_2,C_1,C_2\\)</span> 是下式构造的四个表示；DNF、CNF 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_1\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_1,x_2\\}},T_{\\{\\bar x_1,x_2\\}}\\},\\qquad D_2\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_2\\}}\\},\\qquad C_1\\coloneqq\\{C_{\\{x_1,x_2\\}},C_{\\{\\bar x_1,x_2\\}}\\},\\qquad C_2\\coloneqq\\{C_{\\{x_2\\}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_1\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_1,x_2\\}},T_{\\{\\bar x_1,x_2\\}}\\},\\qquad D_2\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_2\\}}\\},\\qquad C_1\\coloneqq\\{C_{\\{x_1,x_2\\}},C_{\\{\\bar x_1,x_2\\}}\\},\\qquad C_2\\coloneqq\\{C_{\\{x_2\\}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_1\\neq D_2\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_1)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_2)\\land C_1\\neq C_2\\land\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C_1)=\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C_2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_1\\neq D_2\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_1)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_2)\\land C_1\\neq C_2\\land\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C_1)=\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C_2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All four representations compute the projection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto x_2\">\\(x\\mapsto x_2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}